    "identifier": "death-blossom",
    "description": "<p>You strike a downed creature in the chest, in an attempt to stop their beating heart with a single strike. Make a melee taijutsu attack. On a hit, the target must make a constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they take 10d6 in necrotic damage which cannot be reduced by any means or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>Finisher: On a failed save, affected creatures gain 5 ranks of Bleed.</p>",
